{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episodes 1 and 2 are  complete. If you purchase the game now, you will receive the full version and all future updates free of charge.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00abThe Guardian of Nature\u00bb is a wholesome puzzle adventure game about the interconnectedness of nature, created in a wonderful hand-drawn and hand-animation style. You play as Henry, a Guardian of Nature who needs to go on a magical journey to save nature and The Tree of Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/569fa5e4fc3012f9a8108a132722c7f2.poster.avif?t=1763384755\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/569fa5e4fc3012f9a8108a132722c7f2.webm?t=1763384755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Change size</strong> to explore nature large and small.\u00a0\u2728\u00a0<strong>Explore environments</strong> above and below ground. \u2728 Find and use <strong>inventory items</strong>. \u2728 Find out how nature is interconnected and <strong>fill up the Book of Nature </strong>with discoveries you make along the way. \u2728 Solve nature-inspired and <strong>solarpunk puzzles </strong>and learn about the intricate inventions of the Guardians. \u2728 A wonderful <strong>blend of wholesome experience and a modern twist on point-and-click adventures</strong>. Cozy gamers and old-school adventure gamers will feel right at home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/2bf3cff88699f13246857c9e8116447f.poster.avif?t=1763384755\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/2bf3cff88699f13246857c9e8116447f.webm?t=1763384755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 CHANGE SIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key feature of the game is that Henry can <strong>change in size to access game environments large and small</strong>, above and below ground. This allows you not only to wonder through forests and gardens but access ant hills or even fly on birds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf33 EXPORE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game and story consist of three episodes, told in a linear order. Each act consists of <strong>different game environments</strong>. To continue your journey, you must explore how these environments are connected and solve various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/cb043c969687397bb48c4c7943c1f535.poster.avif?t=1763384755\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/cb043c969687397bb48c4c7943c1f535.webm?t=1763384755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf92FIND AND USE INVENTORY ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to continue your journey towards the Tree of Life, you need to <strong>find and use inventory items.</strong>\u00a0They are stored in you backpack and are crucial for connecting the dots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd4 FILL THE BOOK OF NATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of \u00abThe Guardian of Nature\u00bb is told through a wonderful fairytale-inpired narration, filling the Book of Nature step-by-step. Throughout the game you will regularly <strong>find and collect \u201cNature Cards\u201d </strong>which reveal new pages in the book. They tell you more about the ancient wisdom of the Guardians of Nature, the interconnectedness of nature and give you hints on how to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/5f8679db23bd8a57c4952b2cbf74dda6.poster.avif?t=1763384755\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/5f8679db23bd8a57c4952b2cbf74dda6.webm?t=1763384755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b SOLARPUNK ELECTRICITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guardians of Nature have learnt how to use the magical energy flow of mycelial networks underground - which are vital for all trees, plants and living beings - and have built <strong>solarpunk devices</strong>. You need to solve solarpunk puzzles to use the magical power of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/f25b645a7e7882d0e70887d2f0afe2bc.poster.avif?t=1763384755\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421950/extras/f25b645a7e7882d0e70887d2f0afe2bc.webm?t=1763384755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Backup System Activated","path":